        "0": {
          "id": "0",
          "name": "main.py",
          "contents": "import csv\n\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\nfrom sklearn.tree import DecisionTreeClassifier\n\nfrom helpers import tokenize, visualize_model\n\n\ndef get_features(text):\n  # TODO: Compute bag of words features\n  counts = {}\n  return counts\n\n\n# Read data\nf = open(\"reviews.csv\")\ndata = list(csv.DictReader(f))\n\n# Compute features and labels for data\nall_features = [get_features(row[\"text\"]) for row in data]\noutputs = [row[\"label\"] for row in data]\n\n\n# Get all unique words in dataset\nvocabulary = []\nfor features in all_features:\n  for word in features:\n    if word not in vocabulary:\n      vocabulary.append(word)\nvocabulary.sort()\n\n# For each input, compute feature values for all words in vocabulary\ninputs = []\nfor features in all_features:\n  vector = []\n  for word in vocabulary:\n    if word in features:\n      vector.append(features[word])\n    else:\n      vector.append(0)\n  inputs.append(vector)\n\n# Split data into training and testing sets\ntrain_inputs, test_inputs, train_outputs, test_outputs = train_test_split(\n  inputs, outputs, test_size=0.25\n)\n\n# Train model\nmodel = DecisionTreeClassifier()\nmodel.fit(train_inputs, train_outputs)\n\n# Visualize decision tree\nvisualize_model(model, vocabulary)\n\n# Test model\nmodel_score = model.score(test_inputs, test_outputs)\nprint(\"Model score on test data:\", model_score)\n\nf.close()",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "reviews.csv",
          "contents": "text,label\n\"I loved this book and finished it in a single night.\",positive\n\"I found this book boring and I gave up after two chapters.\",negative\n\"The characters are great and the ending is worth the wait.\",positive\n\"The characters are flat and the slow story dragged on every page.\",negative\n\"I couldn't put it down and I loved every chapter.\",positive\n\"I was disappointed by the ending and by the slow pace.\",negative\n\"A great story with characters I loved from the first page.\",positive\n\"I gave up halfway because the story is slow and boring.\",negative\n\"I loved it so much that I finished the book in two days.\",positive\n\"The pace is slow, the characters are flat, and the ending is a waste.\",negative\n\"The ending is great and I recommend this book to anyone.\",positive\n\"I skipped whole chapters because the boring story dragged so badly.\",negative\n\"I loved the characters and the pace kept me reading late.\",positive\n\"A boring book with flat characters and an ending that disappointed me.\",negative\n\"This book is worth every page, and I loved the ending.\",positive\n\"I struggled to finish this slow book, and the ending was a waste of time.\",negative\n\"I recommend this to anyone who loved the first book.\",positive\n\"The slow story dragged, the characters are flat, and I gave up.\",negative\n\"Great characters, a great ending, and a story I finished far too fast.\",positive\n\"I was disappointed, and I would not recommend this boring book.\",negative\n\"I couldn't put this great book down and I recommend it to everyone.\",positive\n\"Slow, boring, and a waste of a good idea.\",negative\n\"The writing is great and the characters feel real on every page.\",positive\n\"I skipped to the ending because the boring middle dragged so much.\",negative\n\"I loved it, and I recommend the book to all of my friends.\",positive\n\"Flat characters and a slow story made this a boring read.\",negative\n\"The great pace kept me reading, and the ending is worth the wait.\",positive\n\"I gave up on this boring book after the story dragged for a hundred pages.\",negative\n\"I finished this book in one sitting because the story is that great.\",positive\n\"The slow ending disappointed me, and the characters never felt real.\",negative\n\"A book I loved from the first page to the last page.\",positive\n\"Boring from the first page, and I struggled to reach the ending.\",negative\n\"The characters are great, and I couldn't wait to see the ending.\",positive\n\"A waste of time, with flat characters and a slow, boring plot.\",negative\n\"I recommend this book, and I loved the ending most of all.\",positive\n\"I was disappointed by how slow the story moved.\",negative\n\"Great story, great characters, and a book I finished in a weekend.\",positive\n\"The cover is great, but the story inside is a waste of time.\",negative\n\"I couldn't put it down, and I loved the ending.\",positive\n\"Everyone loved this book, but I gave up after two chapters.\",negative\n\"This is a great book and I recommend the whole series.\",positive\n\"This boring book dragged, and I gave up before the ending.\",negative\n\"The pace is slow, but I loved every page of it.\",positive\n\"I struggled through this slow book, and the ending disappointed me.\",negative\n\"I expected it to be boring, but I finished it in a single night.\",positive\n\"Flat writing, a slow pace, and characters I never cared about.\",negative\n\"I loved every page, and I finished the book far too fast.\",positive\n\"I found it boring, and I gave up on the series.\",negative\n\"The ending is great, the characters are great, and the story is worth it.\",positive\n\"A slow, boring book with an ending that was a waste.\",negative\n",
